Looking at these excerpts, the ⟦TERM⟧ consistently refers to a check that detects **inappropriate verbatim carryover / copied phrasing from few-shot examples** (a contamination/leakage detector) — a fundamentally different concept from the defined "repeatability/determinism check" that re-runs one identical prompt twice and diffs the outputs. The mechanism relies on distinctive few-shot styles and is affected by removing/paraphrasing examples, which is incompatible with the defined concept at every level.

